{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107190","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1210719001:0":{"text":"둘 다 구해주려고 온 거예요. 두려워하지 마세요.","source_cn":"女士，我们是来救你们的，别害怕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F482B1B99B614F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210719002:0":{"text":"이제는 안전해요. 더 이상 아무도 여러분을 해치지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"你们安全了，不会再有人伤害你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0496F61622F05F1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210719003:0":{"text":"...저, 정말인가요?","source_cn":"真、真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0B99240DFCA6AAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210719004:0":{"text":"그럼, 남편을 내려줄게...","source_cn":"那我们先把你丈夫放下来——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B2FB0E06D833B15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210719005:0":{"text":"난 저 사람을 살려주고 싶지 않아요! 그러니 끼어들지 마세요! 다 인과응보라고요!","source_cn":"但我不想救他！你们也不要插手！这是他应得的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x250F20049B43ADDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"sa